---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-mist bg-cream">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6 px-6 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Meu Ponto" class="h-10 w-10" />
      <div>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-ink">Meu Ponto</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">Clareza para sua jornada.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 text-sm text-ink-soft">
      <a href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android" class="hover:text-ink">Repositório</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android/blob/main/docs/privacy-policy.md" class="hover:text-ink">Política de Privacidade</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android/blob/main/README.md" class="hover:text-ink">Documentação</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/eibragaa/meu-ponto-android/releases" class="hover:text-ink">Releases</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft">© {year} Meu Ponto. Feito com cuidado, 100% offline.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
